## UNEP MARS casebook data

`data/real/mars_casebook_2026-10-15.json` is the active adapted selection from
the UNEP International Methane Emissions Observatory (IMEO), Eye on Methane /
MARS sources-and-plumes dataset. The October 11, October 13, and October 14 casebooks remain
as historical inputs. The casebooks are distributed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. Their
archive URL, retrieval date, SHA-256, attribution and changes are recorded in
`data/real/README.md`. The dataset license does not apply to this repository's
original software.

## UNEP MARS publisher indicator archives

The dated source ZIPs in `data/real/mars_publisher_archives/releases/2026-10-15/`
and normalized `apps/web/public/data/mars-publisher-indicators.json` contain
UNEP IMEO / MARS Top 50 and country response-rate datasets. They are distributed
under the dataset-specific CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 terms shown in the UNEP MARS catalog
and included publisher archive. Attribution, source URLs, retrieval timestamps,
archive hashes, normalization changes, and the binding source snapshot are
recorded in `data/real/mars_publisher_archives/README.md` and its retrieval
provenance file. This data license is separate from the repository's MIT code
license.

## Linked reports

The casebook stores link metadata only. The linked Kazakhstan, Libya, and
Canada item pages identify CC BY-NC-ND 3.0 IGO terms; the linked Argentina item
did not show an item-level license when reviewed on 2026-10-12. No report text
or PDF is included. Check each item page before relying on or reproducing its
content.

## Bundled interface imagery

Ten WebP files supplied with a UI source package had no source or license
manifest. Their redistribution rights remain unknown and they are excluded
from the MIT grant above. They have been removed from the active web asset
directory. The dev server and production build fail closed for unapproved files
under the web asset directory.
Checksum-matched preservation copies remain outside version control in the
local working environment; they are not app assets or release files.
Previously tracked copies remain in Git history; this release removes them
from the current tree but does not rewrite earlier commits. See
`docs/research/interface-asset-rights-inventory-2026-10-14.md` for hashes,
replacement behavior, and verification boundaries.

## Remote map tiles

Map tiles are fetched at runtime from OpenFreeMap / OpenStreetMap and Esri.
Attribution is rendered in the map UI; each provider's current terms apply.
